	(text "Low-side shunt under the low-side FETs, Kelvin pair ISenseP/ISenseN to the logic board\n(STM32G4 OPAMP in PGA mode). EESM: B_L stays on, so the field current always flows through it.\nPMSM: brake resistor between DC+ and the leg B output, B_L is the chopper switch."
